# 預設排除
*
# 但保留目錄結構與內容類型
!*/
!*.html
!*.eml
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!robots.txt
!PowerOfCopilot.zip
!PowerPoint_Skills/**/SKILL.md
!PowerPoint_Skills/PowerPoint_Skills_Examples.zip
# Cowork 練習手冊：站台要提供簡報與範例檔下載，需明確放行
!CoworkPlaybook/*.pptx
!CoworkPlaybook/*.zip
!CoworkPlaybook/samples/**
!CoworkPlaybook/samples_mfgx/**
!CoworkPlaybook/samples_tel/**
!CoworkPlaybook/samples_air/**
# 工作中暫存目錄一律排除
_trash/
_bak_*/
*_bak_*/

# AI 作業暫存目錄
_working/

# AI 建置工具目錄
_tools/

_preview/
